      "representative_length": 1725,
      "representative_excerpt": "VA further proposes to make clearer existing regulatory exceptions to advance notice which reduce or eliminate overpayment potential. Presently, VR&E must notify veterans of findings affecting receipt of Chapter 31 benefits. VR&E proposes to amend current regulation by adding the term \u201cdecisions\u201d addressing both decisions and findings affecting benefits....",
